# Tecmo Super Bowl (USA): names and comments for tools/convert.py, made
# by tools/import.py from the disassembly's listing. Addresses, names
# and comments only, none of the game's bytes. Each line:
#
#   bank B ADDR          the 8 KB bank B is at ADDR
#   sym NAME VALUE       a name the source gives a value, not a label
#   c B:ADDR LENGTH      a run of instructions
#   l B:ADDR NAME        a label
#   n B:ADDR TEXT        a comment over the line there
#   i B:ADDR EXPR ; TEXT the instruction there: its operand as the source
#                        has it, and its comment (either may be missing)
#   d B:ADDR ; TEXT      a comment on the data there

